      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "JUST A FAVOUR (1) scored well last start as odds-on favourite by a neck at this track in a handy 17.37 beating West On Rose. Well suited by the inside box and has the ability and in winning form. Looks the testing material. WEST ON HALO (2) gave a start and overcame a chequered run to finish into the minors when a 2 length third (30.06) at Northam in a Grade 5. Harder here but expected to feature again. CHEERS JAX (3) has a strong winning strike-rate over this track and trip with two wins and a placing from six tries. Hit the frame latest (17.44) when third at this track in a Grade 4/5. With even luck and a clean start should be around the money. BLUEY BRANN (7) got up for a shock win last time and can measure up again.",
